## Lume's guide, in the bag (G). [title, text]
const GUIDE := [
	["THE LANTERN", "YOUR LANTERN BURNS DOWN ALL NIGHT, AND MATCHES ARE SCARCE: E STRIKES ONE FOR ABOUT 30 SECONDS OF LIGHT. YOUR MATCHBOX HOLDS 6. LAMP OIL REFILLS HALF THE LANTERN, EVEN WHEN IT'S OUT. A GUST OF WIND (YOU'LL BE WARNED) BEATS THE FLAME DOWN TO A SPUTTER - A WINDBREAK OR A STORM LANTERN KEEPS IT SAFE. DRAFTY HALLS MAKE IT BURN FASTER. IN THE LAST QUARTER OF YOUR FUEL THE WOLF MAN SHOWS ITSELF AT THE EDGE OF YOUR SIGHT, WATCHING. WHEN THE FLAME DIES, IT COMES."],
	["THE DARK", "IF YOUR LIGHT DIES, THE WOLF MAN COMES. IT STANDS AT THE EDGE OF THE DARK AND WATCHES. THEN IT DROPS ONTO ALL FOURS AND COMES FOR YOU, OVER WALLS, ROCKS, GRAVES, ANYTHING. IF IT REACHES YOU, IT EATS YOU, AND IT IS OVER. GET LIGHT AND IT BACKS AWAY: A MATCH, LAMP OIL, A FLARE, OR A CANDLE OR GLOWING MUSHROOM CLOSE BY. LET THE DARK BACK IN AND IT COMES BACK."],
	["FIGHTING", "INSECTS HAVE TO TOUCH YOU TO FIGHT. DEMONS STALK YOU, LIGHT OR DARK, AND FIGHT THE SAME WAY: TOUCH ONE, OR LET IT TOUCH YOU, AND THE BATTLE BEGINS. IN BATTLE YOU BOTH CHOOSE IN SECRET. ATTACK VS ATTACK: YOU BOTH TAKE A FULL HIT. DEFENDING LETS ONLY ITS ATK MINUS YOUR DEF THROUGH. A DODGE IS A COIN FLIP. AN ITEM TAKES YOUR TURN BUT KEEPS YOU SAFE THAT ROUND. READ ITS NATURE AND ITS TELLS."],
	["GEAR AND THE BAG", "YOUR ATK IS ALL THE WEAPONS YOU CARRY ADDED TOGETHER - THE STRONGEST ONE IS THE ONE IN YOUR HAND. YOUR DEF IS YOUR BEST ARMOR - SPARE ARMOR DOESN'T ADD UP. THE BAG HOLDS 4 THINGS - WEAPONS, ARMOR, POTIONS, KEYS - AND POTIONS AND KEYS STACK UP TO 3. THE DEEPER THE CHEST, THE BETTER THE GEAR, SOMETIMES BLESSED +1 TO +4. CHESTS CAN ALSO STORE WHAT YOU CAN'T CARRY."],
	["DOORS AND KEYS", "BRONZE, SILVER AND GOLD DOORS SPLIT THE LABYRINTH. EACH ONE'S KEY IS HIDDEN ON YOUR SIDE OF IT, IN A CHEST OR ON THE FLOOR, AND BREAKS IN THE LOCK. THE PURPLE MASTER KEY OPENS THE MASTER CHAMBER. PLANT A FLARE (F) TO PUT A ROOM ON YOUR MAP (M)."],
	["WANDERING FLAMES", "FLAMES LIKE ME DRIFT THROUGH THE LABYRINTH. WALK INTO ONE AND IT ASKS A RIDDLE. ANSWER RIGHT AND CHOOSE: A BLESSING (+2 TO +4 ON A WEAPON OR ARMOR) OR A CLUE (YOUR NEXT DOOR, OR WHERE ITS KEY LIES, ON YOUR MAP). ANSWER WRONG AND IT FADES AWAY FOR GOOD."],
	["DAY AND NIGHT", "NIGHTS LAST 15 MINUTES, DAYS 5. BY DAY THE LANTERN RESTS, THE DEMONS ARE GONE AND THE WOLF MAN WITH THEM - THE BEST TIME TO EXPLORE. THE CLOCK COUNTS DOWN THE LAST MINUTE BEFORE DAWN OR DUSK. ONCE YOU'RE MOST OF THE WAY IN, THE NIGHT NEVER ENDS."],
	["HEALING", "HEALING TONICS (A FULL HEAL) LIE IN CHESTS AND ON THE FLOOR - MORE OF THEM WHERE IT'S MORE DANGEROUS. RED BERRIES (+3) GROW IN THE FORESTS AND BY THE RIVERS: WALK INTO A BUSH TO PICK THEM. BLUE BERRIES GROW IN THE SWAMPS AND MOUNTAINS: CRUSH THEM INTO YOUR LANTERN AND FOR A MINUTE, CREATURES FLEE ITS LIGHT. BUSHES GROW BACK AT DAWN. CHESTS HOLD BERRIES TOO - AND, RARELY, A SUNSTONE: TWO MINUTES OF LIGHT THAT FILLS THE WHOLE SCREEN, BURNS NO FUEL AND LAUGHS AT THE WIND."],
	["DANGERS", "WATCH THE GROUND. EVERY LAND HAS ITS OWN TRAPS: SPIKE PLATES, TRAPDOORS, BEAR TRAPS, FALLING ROCK, QUICKSAND, POISON VENTS. THE DEEPER YOU GO, THE MORE THEY HURT. HOLD Z TO RUN - BUT WATCH YOUR ENERGY BAR. WHEN IT'S GONE, YOU'RE WINDED FOR A MOMENT."],
	["BOMBS", "SOMETIMES A CHEST HOLDS A BOMB. PRESS B (OR USE IT FROM THE BAG) TO PLANT ONE AT YOUR FEET - THEN RUN. THE FUSE IS SHORT. WHEN IT BLOWS, EVERY INSECT AND DEMON CLOSE BY IS BLOWN TO SMOKE, AND IF THE WOLF MAN IS CLOSE, IT BACKS OFF FOR A FEW SECONDS. STAND TOO CLOSE AND IT CATCHES YOU TOO. BOMBS STACK UP TO 3."],
	["THE COMMANDMENTS", ""],
