	["HIGH GROUND", "OUT IN THE OPEN THE LAND RISES INTO HILLS AND TERRACES, NOW AND THEN TWO LEVELS HIGH. YOU CAN'T CLIMB A CLIFF - FIND THE SLOPE THAT LEADS UP. IN THE CRYPTS, SOME ROOMS HAVE A RAISED DAIS AT THE BACK: TAKE THE STAIRS."],
	["VILLAGES", "BEHIND A FEW WALLS IN THE LABYRINTH, PEOPLE STILL LIVE. NOTHING FROM OUTSIDE GETS PAST THE GUARDS: NO CREATURES, NO WOLF MAN, NO WIND, AND YOUR LANTERN BURNS NO FUEL UNDER THE LAMPS. WALK INTO A DOOR (OR PRESS Z FACING IT) TO GO IN. THE SHOP SELLS TONICS, FLARES, MATCHES AND LANTERNS. THE SAGE MENDS YOUR WOUNDS. AT THE INN YOU CAN SLEEP UNTIL MORNING - FOR EVERYONE. PICK BERRIES ON THE FARM, AND TALK TO PEOPLE (Z): THEY KNOW THINGS."],
	["RUBIES", "THE VILLAGES TRADE IN RUBIES. THEY LIE IN ODD CORNERS LIKE MATCHES (WALK OVER THEM), HIDE IN CHESTS, AND FALL FROM CREATURES YOU BEAT. THE DEEPER YOU GO, THE MORE YOU FIND. THERE ARE NEVER ENOUGH FOR EVERYTHING - CHOOSE WHAT KEEPS YOU ALIVE."],
	["TWO PLAYERS", "A FRIEND CAN JOIN ANY TIME: PRESS START ON A SECOND CONTROLLER, OR J ON THE KEYBOARD. YOU EACH GET 8 HEARTS, YOUR OWN BAG, LANTERN AND MATCHES. THE MAP, FLARES, DOORS AND CHESTS ARE SHARED. WALK APART AND THE SCREEN SPLITS; COME BACK TOGETHER AND IT MERGES. STAND CLOSE AND PRESS T (PLAYER 2: J, CONTROLLER: X) TO TRADE. LEAVE FROM THE BAG - YOUR HEARTS GO TO YOUR PARTNER. IF ONE OF YOU FALLS, THEY'RE KNOCKED OUT FOR A FEW SECONDS AND GET BACK UP BESIDE THEIR PARTNER. IF YOU BOTH FALL, THE RUN IS OVER."],
